  "incompatible_versions": {
    "1.4.0": "Updating to v1.4.0 repointed the systemd service to 'python3 -m genpi', which the in-app updater cannot change (it only restarts the existing unit) -- a web update would relaunch the old code and report a false success. Install it manually: on the device, pull the release and run ./setup.sh reinstall (or ./update.sh).",
    "1.5.0": "v1.5.0 completes the internal split of the app into the genpi/ package (~20 modules) -- too large and structural a change to apply in place safely. Install it manually: on the device, pull the release and run ./setup.sh reinstall (or ./update.sh). Future releases update in-app normally again."
  }
